// Charges left on the Amulet of chemistry, 5 down to 0.
//
// A VARP RATHER THAN A CHARGE CHAIN, which is the opposite of how every other charged item in this
// build works (the glory, the games necklace and the five imported teleport items are each five or
// eight separate objs with next_obj_stage pointing down the chain). Old School has exactly ONE
// amulet of chemistry obj - the name carries no count and there is no (4)/(3)/(2)/(1) family in the
// cache to import - so the count has nowhere to live but here.
[herblore_chemistry_charges]
scope=perm
